# Every endpoint from spec §8.2. Run in VS Code (REST Client), Rider or Visual Studio.
# Book IDs come from `seed --seed 42`: 6442 is the hottest book, 1 is "Na Drini ćuprija".
@base = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = dev-key

### Health: liveness and readiness (SQL + Hangfire)
GET {{base}}/health
###
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Books: search (normalised: Cyrillic and diacritics work), paging, sorting
GET {{base}}/api/books?q=drini&page=1&pageSize=5
###
GET {{base}}/api/books?q=АНДРИЋ&sort=-listingCount
###
GET {{base}}/api/books?sort=-lastSeen&pageSize=3

### Book detail
GET {{base}}/api/books/1
### 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{base}}/api/books/99999999

### Stats (FR-13)
GET {{base}}/api/books/6442/stats?windowDays=30
###
GET {{base}}/api/books/6442/stats?windowDays=400

### Listings (FR-14)
GET {{base}}/api/books/6442/listings?status=active&sort=-price&pageSize=5
###
GET {{base}}/api/books/1/listings?status=all

### Price history (FR-14)
GET {{base}}/api/books/6442/price-history?bucket=week
###
GET {{base}}/api/books/6442/price-history?from=2026-10-10&to=2026-10-01

### Lookup (FR-15): the flea-market question
GET {{base}}/api/lookup?title=Na Drini cuprija&author=Ivo Andric&askingPrice=400
###
GET {{base}}/api/lookup?title=НА ДРИНИ ЋУПРИЈА&askingPrice=900
### Ambiguous: two books called "Pesme"
GET {{base}}/api/lookup?title=Pesme&askingPrice=300
### 400 validation
GET {{base}}/api/lookup?title=x&askingPrice=0

### Ingestion runs (FR-2, FR-17): needs X-Api-Key
POST {{base}}/api/ingestion/runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{ "source": "fixture", "fixtureSet": "run-001" }

### Same request with an Idempotency-Key: the second call returns the existing run (200)
POST {{base}}/api/ingestion/runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: 7d9f5a2e-1c3b-4e8f-9a6d-2b4c8e1f0a37

{ "source": "kp", "fixtureSet": "run-001" }

### 401 without key
POST {{base}}/api/ingestion/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "fixture", "fixtureSet": "run-001" }

###
GET {{base}}/api/ingestion/runs?pageSize=5
###
GET {{base}}/api/ingestion/runs/181
